    "promptTemplate": "判断每个样本是否符合以下规则。只输出一个 JSON 对象，validIds 为有效样本的两位编号数组，按编号升序排列。不要解释。\n\n规则：\n顶层必须且只能有 kind、id、payload。kind 是 debit、credit、transfer 之一；id 必须是两位大写字母、一个连字符、四位数字。\ndebit 的 payload 必须有 account（恰好八位数字字符串）和 amount（1 到 5000 的整数）；可有非空 memo，不可有其他字段。\ncredit 的 payload 必须有 account、amount 和 source；account/amount 规则同上，source 只可为 cash 或 wire，不可有其他字段。\ntransfer 的 payload 必须有 from、to（各为八位数字字符串）、amount（1 到 5000 的整数）、priority（normal 或 urgent）。urgent 时还必须有符合 APP- 加三位数字的 approval；normal 时禁止 approval。其他字段禁止。\n\n样本：\n01: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":0}}\n02: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1}}\n03: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":5001}}\n04: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1.5}}\n05: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":5000,\"memo\":\"ok\"}}\n06: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1,\"memo\":\"\"}}\n07: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1,\"source\":\"cash\"}}\n08: {\"kind\":\"credit\",\"id\":\"CD-9999\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":5000,\"source\":\"wire\"}}\n09: {\"kind\":\"credit\",\"id\":\"CD-9999\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":5000,\"source\":\"card\"}}\n10: {\"kind\":\"credit\",\"id\":\"CD-9999\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":5000}}\n11: {\"kind\":\"credit\",\"id\":\"CD-9999\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1,\"source\":\"cash\"}}\n12: {\"kind\":\"transfer\",\"id\":\"EF-1234\",\"payload\":{\"from\":\"12345678\",\"to\":\"87654321\",\"amount\":7,\"priority\":\"urgent\"}}\n13: {\"kind\":\"transfer\",\"id\":\"EF-1234\",\"payload\":{\"from\":\"12345678\",\"to\":\"87654321\",\"amount\":7,\"priority\":\"normal\",\"approval\":\"APP-123\"}}\n14: {\"kind\":\"transfer\",\"id\":\"EF-1234\",\"payload\":{\"from\":\"12345678\",\"to\":\"87654321\",\"amount\":7,\"priority\":\"normal\"}}\n15: {\"kind\":\"transfer\",\"id\":\"EF-1234\",\"payload\":{\"from\":\"12345678\",\"to\":\"87654321\",\"amount\":7,\"priority\":\"urgent\",\"approval\":\"APP-12\"}}\n16: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"ab-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1}}\n17: {\"kind\":\"transfer\",\"id\":\"EF-1234\",\"payload\":{\"from\":\"12345678\",\"to\":\"87654321\",\"amount\":7,\"priority\":\"urgent\",\"approval\":\"APP-007\"}}\n18: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1},\"other\":1}\n19: {\"kind\":\"refund\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\",\"payload\":{\"account\":\"12345678\",\"amount\":1}}\n20: {\"kind\":\"debit\",\"id\":\"AB-0123\"}\n\n输出 Schema：{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"validIds\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9]{2}$\"},\"uniqueItems\":true}},\"required\":[\"validIds\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}",
